WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.910
I flew through the dust around a comet and caught tiny grains in a catcher made of aerogel, one of the lightest solids ever made.

2
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:18.600
I sent my capsule down to the Utah desert with the first comet dust ever brought to Earth.

3
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:24.000
Then I visited one more comet and burned my last drop of fuel.

4
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.020
I brought a comet home.
